        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 328df783-28d3-40ce-8f5a-3817a356d0ed).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening Agent 47,\r\rI am sorry to interrupt you on your vacation to the Maldives. I have news that there are some bad people present on Haven Island, where you are currently staying. Prior to coming to Haven Island, these individuals have been involved in various crimes of murder and also Murder but like really bad murder. Anyway, knowing these bad people exist, I&apos;d hate for you to be bothered by them on your vacation. \r\rPlease murder them and enjoy the rest of your day.\r\rAll the best,\rDiana",
